theorem nF_ne_zero_of_left_inv (hF : MulF) {K ι κ : Type} [NormedField K] [IsUltrametricDist K] [Fintype ι] [Fintype κ]
    [DecidableEq κ] {A : Matrix ι κ K} {Y : Matrix κ ι K} (h : Y * A = 1) : nF A ≠ 0 := by
  intro h0
  have h1 := one_le_sz_pow_mul_nF hF h
  rw [h0, mul_zero] at h1
  linarith

/- English proof (translation)
Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact. Use the polynomial consequences of the given equalities and inequalities. A detailed English derivation is pending.
